  "notes": "Herdr fork preview (wwelder/herdr): push alerts name their session\n\nSource: 631edba7c92be50db11abc22f38954acf695a535 (wwelder/herdr#1).\n\n- Push alerts carry `session` (`default` for the unnamed one). Pane ids repeat across herdr sessions, and every session on a machine pushes to the same phones, so HerdrUp now opens a tapped alert on the session that sent it.\n- Updates now come from wwelder/herdr. The updater reads this repository's signed preview manifest and installs only its own release assets, verified with this fork's minisign release key (1E067B988F27A0D0).\n\nUpdate with `herdr update` on the preview channel. All five assets are built from the pinned source commit.",
